<title>FINLAND: FINNISH MUNICIPAL ELECTION, RESULTS OF POST VOTES.</title>
<headline>FINNISH MUNICIPAL ELECTION, RESULTS OF POST VOTES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Support for the main parties in</p>
<p>Finland's local government election according to preliminary</p>
<p>results on Sunday (votes cast in advance at post offices, pct):</p>
<p>Whole country:</p>
<p>			Municipal	    Parliament     Municipal</p>
<p>		     election 1996	election 1995  election 1992</p>
<p> SDP		     25.3		   28.3	     27.1</p>
<p> Centre Party	  22.6		   19.8	     19.2</p>
<p> Conservatives	 22.2		   17.9	     19.1</p>
<p> Leftist Alliance    10.9		   11.2	     11.7</p>
<p> Green Party	    4.7		    6.5		6.9</p>
<p> Swedish Party	  4.5		    5.1		5.0</p>
<p> Christian League     3.5		    3.0		3.2</p>
<p> Young Finns	    1.0		    2.8		N/A</p>
<p>Full unofficial results are due around 2230 local time (1930</p>
<p>GMT).</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
